             SDK.Shared.fs). -->
        <Compile Include="Shared\Types\LocaleTypes.fs" />
        <!-- Phase 594 — pinned data-vocabulary packs: versioned, immutable
             TypeName → schema documents + governance / drift / canonical-JSON
             helpers (+ server-only hash / loader). Before SDK.Shared.fs so
             ServerConfig can carry the pinned-pack + declared-schema fields.
             Fable-safe types + pure helpers; SHA-256 hash / STJ loader guarded
             under #if !FABLE_COMPILER (the JwtCrypto ship-with-guard pattern). -->
        <Compile Include="Shared\DataVocabulary.fs" />
        <!-- Phase 318 — external-compute value types (ExternalHandle /
             ExternalWorkSpec / ExternalOutcome / ExternalComputeError) + the
             ExternalComputeMode opt-in DU. Before SDK.Shared.fs so
             ServerConfig can carry an `ExternalCompute` field. Pure /
             Fable-safe (BCL primitives only — no backend SDK type), so a
             Client can hold an ExternalHandle opaquely. -->
        <!-- Phase 451 — compute-budget value types (SubmitterClass /
             ComputeBudget / ComputeBudgetDenial / ComputeBudgetUsage) + the
             pure admission policy + the ComputeBudgetMode opt-in DU. BEFORE
             ExternalCompute.fs, because ExternalWorkSpec carries a
             SubmitterClass — which is also why the denial's projection onto
