             mutual; see the file header). Before SDK.Shared.fs (ServerConfig
             carries a `ComputeBudget` field), AuditTypes.fs (the denial rides
             two audit payloads) and ModelExecutionWire.fs (it rides the typed
             peer refusal, plan decision D6). Pure / Fable-safe — the cost
             model and the store are Server-tier. -->
        <Compile Include="Shared\ComputeBudget.fs" />
        <!-- Phase 654 — the signed-shape separator registry: the closed
             `SignedShape` DU, its typed `SignedShapeSeparator` parts, and
