             BCL primitives, so its position is set only by its consumers:
             BEFORE ExternalCompute.fs (whose `WorkerOutcomeSignature.Domain`
             reads from it), and in Platform.Core at all because
             `ToolUp.InterPlatform` — which holds the other four encoders —
             references this project and not the reverse. Pure / Fable-safe
             (strings + DU + list, no crypto and no reflection), so it ships
             in the Fable-packed source with the rest of Shared/. -->
        <Compile Include="Shared\SignedShapeSeparator.fs" />
